        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce</strong> is a hypnotic 2D arcade rhythm challenge where you control a bouncing ball in a dazzlingly colorful world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm is your guide:</strong> Jump up to the beat of a powerful soundtrack. The music isn't just background; it's the pulse of the game, guiding you when to act.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful chaos:</strong> Break through a kaleidoscope of ever-changing obstacles. You'll face an explosion of colors and new challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect control:</strong> All you need is a cool head and a single click. Tap to jump upwards. Skillfully maneuver between traps, moving blocks, and narrow passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless drive:</strong> Fight for a place on the leaderboards. How many meters can you conquer before gravity takes over?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual ecstasy:</strong> Simple yet juicy graphics create a unique feeling of total immersion in this shimmering world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Leaderboards:</strong> Unlock unique achievements and prove to everyone who the true rhythm king is on the global leaderboards!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce</strong> is a hypnotic 2D arcade rhythm challenge where you control a bouncing ball in a dazzlingly colorful world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm is your guide:</strong> Jump up to the beat of a powerful soundtrack. The music isn't just background; it's the pulse of the game, guiding you when to act.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful chaos:</strong> Break through a kaleidoscope of ever-changing obstacles. You'll face an explosion of colors and new challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect control:</strong> All you need is a cool head and a single click. Tap to jump upwards. Skillfully maneuver between traps, moving blocks, and narrow passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless drive:</strong> Fight for a place on the leaderboards. How many meters can you conquer before gravity takes over?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual ecstasy:</strong> Simple yet juicy graphics create a unique feeling of total immersion in this shimmering world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Leaderboards:</strong> Unlock unique achievements and prove to everyone who the true rhythm king is on the global leaderboards!</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "An exciting 2D arcade game where you control a ball to the rhythm of music. Break through a kaleidoscope of colorful obstacles using just one rule: click to jump up. Conquer new heights and prove your skills in this hypnotic challenge!",
